WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:04.425
Unit twenty-four. Environmental Health!

2
00:00:05.378 --> 00:00:09.255
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:09.305 --> 00:00:12.786
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.836 --> 00:00:16.920
Today we learn about Environmental Health. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.744 --> 00:00:21.594
Environment. Say it with me. Environment!

6
00:00:25.105 --> 00:00:28.438
Waste. Say it with me. Waste!

7
00:00:31.937 --> 00:00:35.553
Plastic. Say it with me. Plastic!

8
00:00:39.058 --> 00:00:42.225
Burning. Say it with me. Burning!

9
00:00:45.725 --> 00:00:49.141
Air. Say it with me. Air!

10
00:00:52.649 --> 00:00:56.082
Water. Say it with me. Water!

11
00:00:59.614 --> 00:01:03.398
Recycling. Say it with me. Recycling!

12
00:01:06.857 --> 00:01:10.507
Community. Say it with me. Community!

13
00:01:14.015 --> 00:01:24.833
Our health depends on a clean environment. Burning plastic and waste pollutes the air and water. Recycling and proper waste disposal protect the community.

14
00:01:24.883 --> 00:01:26.303
I can do that too!

15
00:01:27.581 --> 00:01:32.640
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:32.690 --> 00:01:33.840
Plastic!

17
00:01:34.738 --> 00:01:39.924
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:39.974 --> 00:01:41.124
Recycling!

19
00:01:42.127 --> 00:01:46.892
Did you know? Clean air, water and soil are all important for human health!

20
00:01:46.942 --> 00:01:49.042
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:50.494 --> 00:01:59.362
Think and answer. What environmental problem affects health where you live?

22
00:01:59.412 --> 00:02:00.562
Great answer!

23
00:02:01.787 --> 00:02:06.656
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:06.706 --> 00:02:09.311
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

